{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106070","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106070/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106070/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106070/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106070","id":3037951674,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6U2ViG","number":106070,"title":"Fix for Node3D request gizmos multiple times","user":{"login":"IphStich","id":5625804,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU2MjU4MDQ=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5625804?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/IphStich","html_url":"https://github.com/IphStich","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IphStich/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IphStich/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IphStich/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IphStich/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IphStich/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IphStich/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IphStich/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IphStich/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IphStich/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","color":"ff6055","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708289,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4Mjg5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:3d","name":"topic:3d","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/22","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22/labels","id":12070367,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AuC3f","number":22,"title":"4.5","description":"","creator":{"login":"Sauermann","id":6299227,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYyOTkyMjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6299227?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann","html_url":"https://github.com/Sauermann","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":3687,"state":"closed","created_at":"2024-12-19T08:51:28Z","updated_at":"2026-09-04T21:48:38Z","due_on":"2025-09-15T00:00:00Z","closed_at":"2025-09-18T17:13:14Z"},"comments":1,"created_at":"2025-05-04T11:37:03Z","updated_at":"2026-02-07T12:37:30Z","closed_at":"2025-07-22T16:27:18Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/106070","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106070","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106070.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106070.patch","merged_at":"2025-07-22T16:27:18Z"},"body":"FIXES: #88119\r\n\r\nThis can result in multiple gizmos being created for the same nodes in some circumstances\r\n\r\nRequests for node gizmos are meant to happen only once, as specified in the [documentation](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/4.4/classes/class_editornode3dgizmoplugin.html#class-editornode3dgizmoplugin-private-method-has-gizmo) \"Whenever a node is added to a scene this method is called\".\r\n\r\nIn practice, it was possible for this to be called multiple times in some circumstances, resulting in multiple gizmos being created for a given node.\r\n\r\nTo Reproduce Error:\r\n1. Create new 3D scene from FileSystem dock\r\n2. With the scene open, select the created Node3D\r\n3. Save the scene by pressing Ctrl + S\r\n4. Click Scene > Reload Saved Scene\r\n5. (you will now have multiple gizmos requested for the selected Node3D)\r\n\r\nIt is possible to reproduce this problem in other ways that are more complex and less likely to occur, and more impactful, while harder to debug. (Took me several hours of debugging to narrow it down to a `emit_changed.call_deferred()` being called by a setter function applying initial `@export` values to an instance in the scene - these were then being executed in order, and resulted in many deffered calls to `_request_gizmo` being stacked due to multiple `update_gizmos` calls)\r\n\r\n(as an aside, it is likely that repeated and un-needed calls to `_request_gizmo` are being made for nodes that have no applicable gizmos)\r\n\r\nFor the plugin, the following code shoud suffice for testing/debugging purposes.\r\n\r\n```GDScript\r\n@tool\r\nextends EditorPlugin\r\n\r\nvar gizmo_plugin = MyGizmo.new()\r\nfunc _enter_tree() -> void:\r\n\tadd_node_3d_gizmo_plugin(gizmo_plugin)\r\nfunc _exit_tree() -> void:\r\n\tremove_node_3d_gizmo_plugin(gizmo_plugin)\r\n\r\nclass MyGizmo extends EditorNode3DGizmoPlugin:\r\n\tfunc _has_gizmo(for_node_3d: Node3D) -> bool:\r\n\t\tprint(for_node_3d)\r\n\t\treturn false\r\n```\r\n\r\n(note: this is my first ever pull request! sorry if this comes off as strange)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106070/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106070/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}